# Google Maps Platform API Key (never commit real keys!)
#
# Option 1 (Free Zero-Billing Prototyping): Obtain a Maps Demo Key
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
#   3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms
#   4. Click "Generate / Reveal Key" and paste it below into .env.local
#
# Option 2 (Production): Create and restrict an API key in Google Cloud Console
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Address Validation API, Routes API, Maps Static API
#   Restrict the key by HTTP referrer and enabled APIs:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
